SUMMARY:Hold the Date! Santa is coming...
DESCRIPTION:These Boots Are Made for Hiking\n**XMAS IS COMING AND WHO BETT
 ER TO CELEBRATE WITH BUT THESE BOOTS!**\nYou may have heard the rumors but
  we throw an epic party with a DJ - get your dancing shoes- funny skits\, 
 and rumors says Santa might be there on the roof!\nLocation is coming!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/these-boots-are-made-for-hiking/event
 s/316784818/
