BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: These Boots Are Made for Hiking
UID:event_316355247@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261107T055712Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261220T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261220T130000
SUMMARY:Our Annual Giving Back! Sandwich Making for Charity
DESCRIPTION:These Boots Are Made for Hiking\n**Meetup Location**: **Toront
 o Sailing and Canoe Club**\n**1391 Lakeshore Blvd\, M6K 3C1**\n\nHold the 
 date!\nJoin us for champagne and our sandwich making event for two downtow
 n shelters. Food for shelters are at a long time low\, and rely on donatio
 ns including ours at this time of year. Last year we made 750 sandwiches!\
 n**Show your holiday spirit and lets see if we can beat our record!**\nHer
 e's how it works:\nYou bring a loaf of bread or two ( you can also bring p
 itas to stuff and wraps) and filling for the sandwiches. We have different
  stations for sandwich makers\, wrappers\, labelers and packers.\n**It's c
 haotic\, and a lot of [fun...and](http://fun...and/) there is champagne in
 volved.**\nHere are just a few suggestions for sandwiches -\npeanut butter
  and jam\negg salad - cook and peel your eggs before you arrive\ntuna or s
 almon salad\nham and cheese\ncheese\nchick pea\nCucumber\, salad\, and cre
 am cheese\nSalmon\, rice and cucumber\nSee you soon! xoxox
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/these-boots-are-made-for-hiking/event
 s/316355247/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260831T153623Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260831T153623Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
